{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a09d93ae-fe8c-86ac-b617-f2df33015b1c",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:52:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Linda Sherman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:50:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:50:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. I'm trying to find out about a curb cut. For a driveway. I think that's what it's called, a curb cut?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:50:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what it's called. You're widening an existing driveway or putting in a new one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:50:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A new one. Well, I think new. The curb is, um, all the way along right now, there's no break in it. So I'd want a break. Is that a new cut or a, a change?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:50:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If there's no opening in the curb now, that's a new curb cut."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:50:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So who do I hire? A contractor? A paving person? I don't know whose job the curb is. Is it the city's curb or mine?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:50:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The curb is the city's, since it's in the public right of way. But you'd hire a licensed contractor to do the work. Paving or excavation outfits usually handle it, and they pull the permit with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:50:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, so the contractor pulls it, or I pull it? I thought I had to fill out the form myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:50:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either one. Some contractors do the paperwork for you, some want the homeowner to sign. Ask them when you get quotes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:51:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And who approves it? Is that you, in your office, or is it Public Works? Because somebody on the other phone said Public Works, and then somebody else said here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:51:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both have a hand in it. Public Works signs off on the curb and the street side, and we look at the driveway on your lot. The application goes through us to start."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:51:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Okay, both. Hm. And how long does the approval take? Like days? Weeks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:51:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Figure a few weeks, give or take. It's slower right now, we've got storm calls from the nor'easter that ended Saturday backing things up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:51:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure. Sorry, I'm a stock clerk, so I'm on my lunch, well, there's a lull between deliveries, so I have maybe ten minutes. I'm still not sure I have the order right. Contractor first, then the form?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:51:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Get your quotes first, then file the application with the contractor's info. You can stop by the office or I can mail you the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:51:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail, please. Oh, my number is 401-555-0184, in case."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:51:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll get that out to you. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:52:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that's it. I think. Thank you."
    }
  ],
